ndex=\"0\">\n        <h3 id=\"vp-tr\">Transcript</h3>\n        <p><time datetime=\"PT0S\">0:00</time>Plan the week on one calm board.</p>\n        <p><time datetime=\"PT2S\">0:02</time>Drafts, docs and tasks stay linked.</p>\n        <p><time datetime=\"PT4S\">0:04</time>Ship it - and everyone sees what changed.</p>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n    <figcaption class=\"mk-video-player-caption\"><h3>Acme in 60 seconds</h3></figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <div\n    style=\"\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 20rem), 1fr));\n      gap: 2rem;\n      align-items: start;\n    \"\n  >\n    <article class=\"mk-audio-player\" data-variant=\"podcast\" aria-labelledby=\"ap-3\">\n      <img\n        class=\"mk-audio-player-cover\"\n        src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/podcast-cover2/600/600\"\n        alt=\"Cover of The Calm Letter podcast\"\n      />\n      <div class=\"mk-audio-player-body\">\n        <span class=\"mk-audio-player-show\">The Calm Letter · Episode 41</span>\n        <h3 class=\"mk-audio-player-title\" id=\"ap-3\">Writing decisions down</h3>\n        <span class=\"mk-audio-player-meta\"\n          >With Hannah Lee · 14 sec · <time datetime=\"2026-09-23\">23 Sep 2026</time></span\n        >\n        <div class=\"mk-audio-player-controls\">\n          <audio controls preload=\"none\" src=\"videos/demo-audio.mp3\"></audio>\n          <a class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" href=\"videos/demo-audio.mp3\" download\n            ><i data-lucide=\"download\"></i> MP3</a\n          >\n        </div>\n        <details class=\"mk-audio-player-notes\">\n          <summary>Show notes</summary>\n          <p>Hannah explains how her team replaced status meetings with written decisions - and what they kept.</p>\n          <ul\n            ><li>0:00 Intro</li\n            ><li>0:05 The decision log</li\n            ><li>0:10 What we kept</li></ul\n          >\n        </details>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n    <ol class=\"mk-playlist\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"The Calm Letter - episodes\" style=\"max-width: 40rem\">\n      <li class=\"mk-playlist-item\" data-variant=\"episode\">\n        <label>\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"episode\" value=\"42\" checked />\n          <span class=\"mk-playlist-item-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\n            ><span>42</span><i class=\"mk-playlist-item-bars\"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i\n          ></span>\n          <img class=\"mk-playlist-item-cover\" src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/ep-42/160/160\" alt=\"\" />\n          <span class=\"mk-playlist-item-text\"\n            ><strong>Why we never ship on Fridays</strong\n            ><small>The Calm Letter · <time datetime=\"2026-09-30\">2026-09-30</time></small\n            ><span class=\"mk-playlist-item-desc\"\n              >Alex and Sophie on release rhythms, weekends and why boring deploys are the best deploys.</span\n            ></span\n          >\n          <span class=\"mk-playlist-item-duration\">32 min</span>\n        </label>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"mk-playlist-item\" data-variant=\"episode\">\n        <label>\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"episode\" value=\"41\" />\n          <span class=\"mk-playlist-item-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\n            ><span>41</span><i class=\"mk-playlist-item-bars\"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i\n          ></span>\n          <img class=\"mk-playlist-item-cover\" src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/ep-41/160/160\" alt=\"\" />\n          <span class=\"mk-playlist-item-text\"\n            ><strong>Writing decisions down</strong\n            ><small>The Calm Letter · <time datetime=\"2026-09-23\">2026-09-23</time></small\n            ><span class=\"mk-playlist-item-desc\"\n              >Hannah explains how her team replaced status meetings with a written decision log.</span\n            ></span\n          >\n          <span class=\"mk-playlist-item-duration\">28 min</span>\n        </label>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n  <figure class=\"mk-before-after\" data-variant=\"toggle\" style=\"max-width: 40rem\">\n    <div class=\"mk-before-after-stage\">\n      <img\n        class=\"mk-before-after-before\"\n        src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/ba-room/1200/800?grayscale\"\n        alt=\"Before: the living room, grey and empty\"\n      />\n      <img\n        class=\"mk-before-after-after\"\n        src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/ba-room/1200/800\"\n        alt=\"After: the living room, furnished and warm\"\n      />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"switch-item mk-before-after-toggle\"\n      ><input class=\"switch\" type=\"checkbox\" role=\"switch\" id=\"ba-toggle\" /><label for=\"ba-toggle\"\n        >Show after</label\n      ></div\n    >\n  </figure>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(17rem, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; width: 100%\">\n    <article class=\"mk-social-post\" data-variant=\"quote\">\n      <header class=\"mk-social-post-head\">\n        <span class=\"avatar\"><img class=\"avatar-image\" src=\"images/mk-portrait2.png\" alt=\"\" /></span>\n        <div class=\"mk-social-post-who\"\n          ><a class=\"mk-social-post-name\" href=\"#\"\n            >Hannah Lee<svg\n              class=\"mk-social-post-verified\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n              width=\"16\"\n              height=\"16\"\n              role=\"img\"\n              aria-label=\"Verified account\"\n            >\n              <path\n                fill=\"currentColor\"\n                d=\"M12 1.5 14.6 4l3.6-.4.9 3.5 3.2 1.8-1.4 3.3 1.4 3.3-3.2 1.8-.9 3.5-3.6-.4L12 22.5 9.4 20l-3.6.4-.9-3.5-3.2-1.8L3.1 12 1.7 8.7l3.2-1.8.9-3.5 3.6.4Z\"\n              />\n              <path\n                d=\"m7.5 12.2 3 3 6-6.4\"\n                fill=\"none\"\n                stroke=\"#fff\"\n                stroke-width=\"2\"\n                stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n                stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n              /></svg></a\n          ><span class=\"mk-social-post-handle\">@hannahdesigns</span></div\n        >\n        <span class=\"mk-social-post-network\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Posted on X\"\n          ><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <path\n              d=\"M18.9 2H22l-6.8 7.8L23.2 22h-6.3l-4.9-6.4L6.4 22H3.3l7.3-8.3L.8 2h6.4l4.4 5.9L18.9 2Zm-1.1 18h1.7L6.3 3.9H4.5L17.8 20Z\"\n            /></svg\n        ></span>\n      </header>\n      <div class=\"mk-social-post-text\"\n        ><p>Acme is the first tool my designers asked to keep after the trial. That never happens.</p></div\n      >\n      <footer class=\"mk-social-post-foot\">\n        <a class=\"mk-social-post-time\" href=\"#\"><time datetime=\"2026-09-12\">Sep 12, 2026</time></a>\n        <ul class=\"mk-social-post-stats\"\n          ><li><i data-lucide=\"heart\"></i>320<span class=\"sr-only\"> likes</span></li></ul\n        >\n      </footer>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"mk-social-post\" data-variant=\"quote\">\n      <header class=\"mk-social-post-head\">\n        <span class=\"avatar\"><img class=\"avatar-image\" src=\"images/mk-portrait.png\" alt=\"\" /></span>\n        <div class=\"mk-social-post-who\"\n          ><a class=\"mk-social-post-name\" href=\"#\"\n            >Marco Rossi<svg\n              class=\"mk-social-post-verified\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n              width=\"16\"\n              height=\"16\"\n              role=\"img\"\n              aria-label=\"Verified account\"\n            >\n              <path\n                fill=\"currentColor\"\n                d=\"M12 1.5 14.6 4l3.6-.4.9 3.5 3.2 1.8-1.4 3.3 1.4 3.3-3.2 1.8-.9 3.5-3.6-.4L12 22.5 9.4 20l-3.6.4-.9-3.5-3.2-1.8L3.1 12 1.7 8.7l3.2-1.8.9-3.5 3.6.4Z\"\n              />\n              <path\n                d=\"m7.5 12.2 3 3 6-6.4\"\n                fill=\"none\"\n                stroke=\"#fff\"\n                stroke-width=\"2\"\n                stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n                stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n              /></svg></a\n          ><span class=\"mk-social-post-handle\">@marco</span></div\n        >\n        <span class=\"mk-social-post-network\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Posted on X\"\n          ><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <path\n              d=\"M18.9 2H22l-6.8 7.8L23.2 22h-6.3l-4.9-6.4L6.4 22H3.3l7.3-8.3L.8 2h6.4l4.4 5.9L18.9 2Zm-1.1 18h1.7L6.3 3.9H4.5L17.8 20Z\"\n            /></svg\n        ></span>\n      </header>\n      <div class=\"mk-social-post-text\"\n        ><p>Our weekly sync went from 90 minutes to 20. I have my Thursday afternoons back.</p></div\n      >\n      <footer class=\"mk-social-post-foot\">\n        <a class=\"mk-social-post-time\" href=\"#\"><time datetime=\"2026-08-30\">Aug 30, 2026</time></a>\n        <ul class=\"mk-social-post-stats\"\n          ><li><i data-lucide=\"heart\"></i>188<span class=\"sr-only\"> likes</span></li></ul\n        >\n      </footer>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","individual":false}]
